4) File a civil suit for easement of necessity or specific relief

If negotiation/administrative routes fail and access is essential, a legal suit claiming easement of necessity or seeking a court order to declare and define a right of way is an option. Courts weigh necessity, alternatives, and proportionality. Expect time and costs. 
